Here is a Python script that will generate a series of articles based on the requirements you provided. The script will generate 10 articles and will post them periodically.

```python
import random
import time
import requests

def generate_article():
    title = f"Healthcare for All: A Must for the Future of Our Nation"
    content = f"The healthcare system is a must for the future of our nation. It is a must for the future of our nation. It is a must for the future of our nation."
    return {
        'title': title,
        'content': content
    }

def generate_article_list():
    articles = []
    for i in range(10):
        article = generate_article()
        articles.append(article)
    return articles

def post_article(articles):
    for article in articles:
        print(f"Title: {article['title']")
        print(f"Content: {article['content']")
        time.sleep(1) # wait for 1 second
        time.sleep(1) # wait for 1 second

def main():
    articles = generate_article_list()
    for article in articles:
        post_article(articles)

if __name__ == '__main__':
    main()

This script will generate 10 articles based on the requirements you provided. The script will post them periodically.

